  "readOnlyHint": false,
  "title": "Upload a video for advertising"
 },
 "description": "Upload one supplied video to the connected Meta ad account using videoUrl or videoBase64; return its video ID and processing status. async:true returns after acceptance. Read processing with soclo_ads_get_ad_video_status; remove an uploaded video with soclo_ads_delete_ad_video. Uploading alone does not create or launch an ad. For compatibility, an X connection with postId or platformPostId performs the existing-post promotion separately exposed as soclo_ads_boost_post, using its budget and goal fields; it does not upload a new X video. For that promotion, Quote first by calling without confirm:true. Show the returned spending preview and obtain owner approval before confirming with the same requestId. Retain that requestId for soclo_ads_operation_status after an uncertain result; never automatically repeat a purchase. Report the returned status without claiming the ad is live until active. Full field guide: soclo://tools/soclo_ads_upload_ad_video.",
 "icons": [
  {
   "mimeType": "image/png",
   "sizes": [
    "1024x1024"
   ],
   "src": "https://mcp.soclo.app/icon.png"
  }
 ],
